// @title Pad on a chord progression
// @category chords
// @details Four chords, one per bar, on a slow and wide saw pad. Change the chord names to change
//   the song.
// @tags pad, progression
// @by alienmind
chord("<Am7 Cmaj7 G Dm7>").voicing()
  .s("supersaw")
  .attack(.3).release(1)
  .lpf(1200).room(.6).gain(.35)
